<title>ESTONIA: BOURSE CLOSE - TALSE UP SLIGHTLY, PRICES MIXED.</title>
<headline>BOURSE CLOSE - TALSE UP SLIGHTLY, PRICES MIXED.</headline>
<text>
<p>* Preliminary data from the bourse on Tuesday put total</p>
<p>trade at 26 million kroons</p>
<p>* The Talse online index was 0.78 percent lower on 253.36.</p>
<p>(See index on stock exchange web site:</p>
<p>http://www.tse.ee/online/total.htm)</p>
<p>* Hoiupank was most active with 8.1 million kroons</p>
<p>traded to be higher on a last deal price of 132.27 kroons.</p>
</text>
